<title>SINGAPORE: Hotel Props 1996 net profit up 50.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Hotel Props 1996 net profit up 50.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended Dec 31 1996</p>
<p>(in million of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 44.13  vs  29.29</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)   10.86  vs   7.28</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	4.00  vs   4.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		  585.59  vs 849.51</p>
<p>    Investment income	 0.73  vs   0.79</p>
<p>    Other/interest income   9.01  vs   4.34</p>
<p>    Interest expense	 20.31  vs  17.19</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   92.68  vs  51.09</p>
<p>    Income from associates  4.60  vs   9.49</p>
<p>    Tax			  36.22  vs  26.28</p>
<p>    Minorities		(16.93) vs  (5.00)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  (3.63) vs  (0.48)</p>
<p>Note - Hotel Properties Ltd is a hotel operator and property development company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 870 3199)</p>
